          "text": "{\"questions\":[{\"scenario\":\"Buying a snack and a ready meal at a 편의점\",\"prompt\":\"Please ask for a shopping bag at the counter.\",\"context\":\"You have two items and want a bag.\",\"spokenPrompt\":\"How would you ask for a bag to put your items in?\",\"choices\":[{\"hangul\":\"봉투 주세요.\",\"romanization\":\"bongtu juseyo.\"},{\"hangul\":\"봉투로 포장해 주세요.\",\"romanization\":\"bongturo pojanghae juseyo.\"},{\"hangul\":\"가방 주세요.\",\"romanization\":\"gabang juseyo.\"}],\"correctAnswerIndex\":0,\"translation\":\"A bag, please.\",\"explanation\":\" 주세요 = please give me; 봉투 is bag, 포장해 주세요 asks for packaging.\",\"teachingPoint\":\"주세요 = please give me; choose the brief, correct way to request a bag.\",\"explanationNarration\":\"A simple polite request using 주세요 is common for items like bags.\"},{\"scenario\":\"Buying a snack and a ready meal at a 편의점\",\"prompt\":\"What do you say to ask for chopsticks?\",\"context\":\"You want chopsticks to eat your meal.\",\"spokenPrompt\":\"How would you ask staff for chopsticks?\",\"choices\":[{\"hangul\":\"젓가락 주세요.\",\"romanization\":\"jeotgarak juseyo.\"},{\"hangul\":\"젓가락으로 주세요.\",\"romanization\":\"jeotgarakseu juseyo.\"},{\"hangul\":\"젓가락이 있어요?\",\"romanization\":\"jeotgaraki isseoyo?\"}],\"correctAnswerIndex\":0,\"translation\":\"Chopsticks, please.\",\"explanation\":\" 주세요 새로 주세요 is incorrect; 젓가락 주세요 is the natural request.\",\"teachingPoint\":\"주세요 + item name is the standard pattern for a polite request.\",\"explanationNarration\":\"Requesting utensils often uses the item followed by 주세요.\"},{\"scenario\":\"Buying a snack and a ready meal at a 편의점\",\"prompt\":\"Please have the staff heat your food.\",\"context\":\"The ready meal is cold when you pick it up.\",\"spokenPrompt\":\"How would you ask to heat your meal?\",\"choices\":[{\"hangul\":\"데우고 주세요.\",\"romanization\":\"deugo juseyo.\"},{\"hangul\":\"따뜻하게 데워 주세요.\",\"romanization\":\"ttatteuthage dewo juseyo.\"},{\"hangul\":\"음식 데워 주세요.\",\"romanization\":\"eumsik dewo juseyo.\"}],\"correctAnswerIndex\":2,\"translation\":\"Please heat the food.\",\"explanation\":\" 음식 데워 주세요 is natural in context; 데워 주세요 is common shorthand.\",\"teachingPoint\":\"데워 주세요 = please heat it up; position the verb appropriately.\",\"explanationNarration\":\"Polite request to heat food should clearly reference the item.\"},{\"scenario\":\"Buying a snack and a ready meal at a 편의점\",\"prompt\":\"Can I pay with a card?\",\"context\":\"You want to know if card payment is possible.\",\"spokenPrompt\":\"Is card payment available here?\",\"choices\":[{\"hangul\":\"카드로 결제할 수 있어요?\",\"romanization\":\"kadeuro gyeolje halssoeyo?\"},{\"hangul\":\"카드로 결제돼요?\",\"romanization\":\"kadeuro gyeoljedoen?\"},{\"hangul\":\"현금으로만 계산해 주세요.\",\"romanization\":\"hyeongeumeu manually juseyo.\"}],\"correctAnswerIndex\":0,\"translation\":\"Can I pay by card?\",\"explanation\":\" 카드로 결제할 수 있어요? is the natural question about card payment.\",\"teachingPoint\":\"카드로 결제할 수 있어요? = Can I pay with a card?\",\"explanationNarration\":\"Ask about payment methods politely before paying.\"},{\"scenario\":\"Buying a snack and a ready meal at a 편의점\",\"prompt\":\"Could you help me locate a specific item in the aisle?\",\"context\":\"You are looking for a particular snack.\",\"spokenPrompt\":\"Where is the oolong tea in this section?\",\"choices\":[{\"hangul\":\"이쪽에 있나요?\",\"romanization\":\"ijjoge innayo?\"},{\"hangul\":\"저쪽에 있어요?\",\"romanization\":\"jeojjoge isseoyo?\"},{\"hangul\":\"이 품목은 어디에 있어요?\",\"romanization\":\"i pummok-eun eodi-e isseoyo?\"}],\"correctAnswerIndex\":2,\"translation\":\"Where is this item?\",\"explanation\":\" 어디에 있어요? means where is it, with item reference.\",\"teachingPoint\":\"어디에 있어요? = where is it; use when asking for location of a specific item.\",\"explanationNarration\":\"Location questions help you find items efficiently.\"}],\"bonus\":{\"scenario\":\"Bonus hard question (public)\",\"prompt\":\"In this store, is there a smaller size available 